        "answer": "The core components of an agentic AI system are:\n\n- **Planner/Reasoner** \u2013 decides the next step to take.   \n- **Tools** \u2013 functions the agent can call (search, retrieval, code execution, API calls).   \n- **Memory** \u2013 short\u2011term (conversation) and long\u2011term (retrieved knowledge, vector stores).   \n- **Loop Control** \u2013 a stopping condition to prevent infinite looping.\n\nSources: (Note: Agentic AI Concepts), (Note: DocuMind Project)",
